FEDERAL URDU
UNIVERSITY OF ARTS, SCIENCES
AND TECHNOLOGY,
ISLAMABAD ORDINANCE, 2002
ORDINANCE CXIX OF
2002
An Ordinance to provide for Establishment of Federal
Urdu University of Arts, Sciences and Technology, Islamabad
CHAPTER III
OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
7. Officers.----- The
following shall be the principal officers of the University, namely:-
(a) the Chancellor;
(b) the Pro-Chancellor;
(c) the Deputy Chair of the Senate;
(d) the Vice-chancellor;
(e) the Deans;
(f) the Principals of the constituent colleges;
(g) the Chairpersons of the teaching departments;
(h) the Registrar;
(i) the Treasurer;
(j) the Controller of Examinations; and
(k) such other persons as may be prescribed
by the Statutes or Regulations to be the principal officers of the University.
